{"speciesId":778,"names":{"fr":"Mimiqui","es":"Mimikyu","en":"Mimikyu","ja":"ミミッキュ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa véritable apparence est inconnue. Les chercheurs qui ont vu sous son déguisement sont littéralement morts de peur."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su verdadero aspecto es un misterio total. Un investigador que intentó mirar dentro del saco recibió, literalmente, un susto de muerte."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its actual appearance is unknown. A scholar who saw what was under its rag was overwhelmed by terror and died from the shock."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"正体不明。 ボロ布の 中身を みた とある 学者は 恐怖の あまり ショック死した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son apparence est si effrayante qu’il doit se déguiser pour oser s’approcher des gens et des autres Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"El saco andrajoso le permite ocultar su aspecto aterrador para acercarse a otros Pokémon o a la gente y vencer así la soledad que lo atenaza."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"A lonely Pokémon, it conceals its terrifying appearance beneath an old rag so it can get closer to people and other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"恐ろしい 姿を ボロ布で 隠し 人や 他のポケモンに 近づく 寂しがりや。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon docile déteste la solitude, mais il oppose une résistance acharnée si l’on essaie de jeter un coup d’œil sous son déguisement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es de carácter tranquilo y propenso a sentirse solo. Odia que intenten mirar bajo su saco, y se resiste con todas sus fuerzas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what’s under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大人しい 寂しがり屋 だけど ボロ切れの 中身を 見ようとすると 激しく 嫌がり 抵抗する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Une bourrasque a un jour permis à un Dresseur de voir sous le déguisement de Mimiqui. Il est mort le soir même dans d’atroces souffrances."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Al levantarse su saco a causa de un golpe de viento, un Entrenador vio su verdadera forma y murió dolorosamente esa misma noche."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A gust of wind revealed what hides under this Pokémon’s rag to a passing Trainer, who went home and died painfully that very night."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"風が 舞って 偶然 中身を 見てしまった トレーナーは その日の 晩に 苦しみ もがいて 死んだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se cache sous des guenilles en forme de Pikachu pour avoir l’air moins effrayant, mais cela le rend encore plus inquiétant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se cubre con un saco andrajoso con aspecto de Pikachu para no resultar tan aterrador, aunque este le confiere un aspecto aún más terrorífico."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It wears a rag fashioned into a Pikachu costume in an effort to look less scary. Unfortunately, the costume only makes it creepier."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"怖がられないように ピカチュウに 似せた ボロ布を かぶっているが 余計に 不気味に なってしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les malheureux chercheurs qui ont regardé sous son déguisement en lambeaux ont succombé à une mystérieuse maladie."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Un investigador que miró dentro del saco para estudiar a este Pokémon perdió la vida a causa de una misteriosa enfermedad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"There was a scientist who peeked under Mimikyu’s old rag in the name of research. The scientist died of a mysterious disease."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"研究のため ボロ布の 中を 見てしまった 学者が 謎の 病気で 命を 落とした。"}],"varieties":[{"id":778,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20